				<r3d:description language="eng">NOMAD Central Platform is a free web service that allows you to share your data or use comprehensive data provided by others. You can use NOMAD Central to organize, analyze, share, and publish your materials science data, as well as explore, download, and analyze the data of your colleagues. NOMAD is not only about sharing files, it is about sharing data and making them FAIR (Findable, Accessible, Interoperable, Reusable). All data in NOMAD are organized in well-defined structures described by a formal schema. When you publish a project, you can assign it a Digital Object Identifier (DOI) so others can cite it.</r3d:description>
