						<r3d:remarks>NOMAD Central is the public deployment of NOMAD, an open-source platform for managing, sharing, and analyzing materials science research data. NOMAD is developed primarily by FAIRmat (https://www.fairmat-nfdi.eu), a consortium of Germany’s National Research Data Infrastructure (NFDI) funded by the German Research Foundation (DFG, project 460197019).

Research groups and institutions can run their own NOMAD instance using NOMAD Oasis (https://about.nomad-lab.eu/nomad-oasis.html). User support is available through the NOMAD Discord community, linked from the official support page (https://about.nomad-lab.eu/support.html).</r3d:remarks>
